He often plays football after school.","file":"phrase-22.wav"},{"text":"This is Sandy.\nShe is tall and slim. She has long hair.\nShe is very polite.\nShe likes music and she can play the piano well.","file":"phrase-23.wav"},{"text":"This is Daniel.\nHe is not tall.\nHe wears glasses.\nHe is smart and always ready to help others.\nHe is interested in science.","file":"phrase-24.wav"},{"text":"Hi, Jenny. I am at Sunshine Middle School now. It is a nice school. I like my new classmates. They are all very friendly.\n\nSandy is a tall girl. She is interested in music. Simon is tall too. He is good at sport. We are friends now.\n\nHow about you? Are you happy at your new school?","file":"phrase-25.wav"},{"text":"We have the same hobbies.","file":"phrase-26.wav"},{"text":"My classmates are all very nice.","file":"phrase-27.wav"},{"text":"Sandy likes listening to piano music.","file":"phrase-28.wav"},{"text":"Simon and Amy go to school by bike.","file":"phrase-29.wav"},{"text":"The students go home by bus.","file":"phrase-30.wav"},{"text":"This is Zhang Ke. Her English name is Kitty. She has long hair. She is pretty and has lovely eyes. She is shy and quiet. She likes dancing.","file":"phrase-31.wav"},{"text":"This is Zhao Min. Her English name is Amy. Her hair is short. She is small and cute. She is always happy. She is good at swimming.","file":"phrase-32.wav"},{"text":"Hi, Millie.\nHi, Simon. Ms Lin, this is my classmate Simon. Simon, this is Ms Lin, our Music teacher.\nGlad to meet you, Ms Lin.\nGlad to meet you too, Simon. You like playing football, right?\nYes, I do. I often play football after school. Sport helps me stay healthy and happy.\nGreat!\nOh, we have a football match with Class 2 at 4:30 this afternoon. I have to go now. Goodbye, Ms Lin. Goodbye, Millie.\nOK. Bye. Good luck!\nBye.","file":"phrase-33.wav"},{"text":"Hi, Millie.","file":"phrase-34.wav"},{"text":"Hi, Simon. Ms Lin, this is my classmate Simon. Simon, this is Ms Lin, our Music teacher.","file":"